<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载住宿信息…</view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{home}}" class="hero"><text class="hero-kicker">我的床位</text><text class="hero-title">{{home.building_name}}</text><text class="hero-copy">{{home.room_no}} 宿舍 · {{home.bed_no}} 床 · 入住于 {{home.check_in_date}}</text></view><view wx:else class="empty">暂未分配床位，请联系管理员</view><text class="section-title">舍友</text><view class="card" wx:if="{{roommates.length}}"><view class="row" wx:for="{{roommates}}" wx:key="student_id"><text>{{item.student_name}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.bed_no}} 床</text></view></view><view wx:else class="card muted">当前没有可显示的舍友信息</view></block></view>
